{% comment %}
  Gutschein-Designer — the storefront page of the Mo gift vouchers
  („Geschenkgutscheine“, mo repo: docs/GIFT_VOUCHERS.md).

  The visitor designs a voucher in five steps — 1 Betrag → 2 Motiv → 3 Text →
  4 Versand → 5 Prüfen & kaufen — with a progress line on top, a live preview
  card next to the steps (under the progress line on phones) and a sticky
  summary bar on phones. Amounts are the variants of a regular product
  (setting „Gutschein-Produkt“, handle designgutschein), the Premium-Karte is
  a paid add-on product (setting „Premium-Karte“, handle
  gutschein-premiumkarte). Designs, AI texts, photo upload, the exact preview,
  the draft and the balance check come from the Mo backend (HTTP contract:
  mo repo, spec §8 — /api/gift-vouchers/*). „Jetzt kaufen“: draft → POST
  /cart/add.js (voucher line + add-on line, both with the private property
  _mo_gv=<token>) → /checkout; „In den Warenkorb“ opens the cart drawer. On
  orders/paid Mo issues a real Shopify gift card and e-mails the PDF.

  Look: the Home-Gym-Konfigurator's „Performance“ design (black pill buttons
  turning blue, blue kicker over a regular-weight headline, white cards with a
  1 px border, bands alternating #ffffff / #f9f9f9, no divider lines, red only
  for errors). Styles: assets/ms-gift-voucher.css (everything under .ms-gv,
  own --gv-* tokens), logic: assets/ms-gift-voucher.js (builds the steps;
  config reaches it only through the data attributes below and the products
  JSON at the end).

  No [data-ms-chat-dock] here (the widget would dock into it). Names, messages
  and addresses never go into a URL: the draft lives in sessionStorage
  (ms-gv-draft) and on the Mo backend. The balance check („Guthaben prüfen“)
  is the anchor #guthaben — the QR code on every voucher points to it.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'ms-gift-voucher.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign gv_en = false
  if request.locale.iso_code == 'en'
    assign gv_en = true
  endif
  assign gv_mo_on = false
  if settings.ai_advisor_enabled and settings.ms_chat_shared_secret != blank
    assign gv_mo_on = true
  endif
  assign gv_api = settings.ai_advisor_backend_url | default: 'https://mo.motionsports.de' | strip
  assign gv_fallback = section.settings.fallback_url | default: '/products/motion-sports-geschenkgutschein'
  assign gv_img = section.settings.hero_image
  assign gv_voucher = section.settings.voucher_product
  assign gv_print = section.settings.print_product
  # A Shopify gift card product must not sell the vouchers: Shopify would
  # issue a second card of its own. Its amounts are then left out (the page
  # shows the fallback; the theme editor says why).
  assign gv_issue = ''
  if gv_voucher == blank
    assign gv_issue = 'missing'
  elsif gv_voucher.gift_card?
    assign gv_issue = 'gift_card'
  endif
  assign gv_print_variant = nil
  if gv_print and gv_print.gift_card? == false
    assign gv_print_variant = gv_print.selected_or_first_available_variant
  endif
-%}

<section
  class="ms-gv"
  id="ms-gv-{{ section.id }}"
  data-ms-gv
  data-locale="{% if gv_en %}en{% else %}de{% endif %}"
  data-mo="{% if gv_mo_on %}on{% else %}off{% endif %}"
  data-api-base="{{ gv_api | escape }}"
  data-key="{{ settings.ms_chat_shared_secret | escape }}"
  data-fallback-url="{{ gv_fallback | escape }}"
  data-terms-url="{{ section.settings.terms_url | escape }}"
  {%- if request.design_mode %} data-design-mode="true"{% endif %}
>
  {%- comment -%} ---------- Hero ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-gv-hero{% if gv_img != blank %} ms-gv-hero--image{% endif %}">
    <div class="ms-gv-wrap ms-gv-hero__inner">
      <div class="ms-gv-hero__copy">
        {%- if section.settings.hero_kicker != blank -%}
          <p class="ms-gv-kicker">{{ section.settings.hero_kicker | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h1 class="ms-gv-hero__title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
        {%- if section.settings.hero_text != blank -%}
          <p class="ms-gv-hero__text">{{ section.settings.hero_text | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="ms-gv-hero__actions">
          <a class="ms-gv-btn ms-gv-btn--primary ms-gv-hero__cta" href="#ms-gv-start-{{ section.id }}" data-ms-gv-scroll>
            <span>{{ section.settings.hero_cta | default: 'Jetzt gestalten' | escape }}</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="ms-gv-link ms-gv-hero__balance" href="#guthaben" data-ms-gv-scroll>{% if gv_en %}Check balance{% else %}Guthaben prüfen{% endif %}</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="ms-gv-trust" role="list">
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4.5 13.5H12L11 22l8.5-11.5H12z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <span>{% if gv_en %}Valid right after purchase{% else %}Sofort gültig nach dem Kauf{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15.5" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3.5 10h17M8 3v4M16 3v4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <span data-ms-gv-validity>{% if gv_en %}Valid for 3 years{% else %}3 Jahre gültig{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5.5" width="18" height="13" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="m3.5 7 8.5 6.5L20.5 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <span data-ms-gv-delivery-trust>{% if gv_en %}As a PDF or premium card{% else %}Als PDF oder Premium-Karte{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The visual: the theme-editor image, or a fan of three voucher cards.
        The cards are drawn here with the brand colours (so they stand without
        the backend) and get the real designs from Mo's config (page JS).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="ms-gv-hero__visual">
        {%- if gv_img != blank -%}
          <div class="ms-gv-hero__media">
            {{ gv_img | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 46vw, 100vw', alt: gv_img.alt, class: 'ms-gv-hero__img' }}
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="ms-gv-stack" data-ms-gv-stack aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ms-gv-stack__card ms-gv-stack__card--back" data-ms-gv-stack-card="2">
              <div class="ms-gv-face ms-gv-face--front ms-gv-face--landscape ms-gv-face--css-navy">
                <div class="ms-gv-face__content">
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__brand">motion sports</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__eyebrow">{% if gv_en %}Gift voucher{% else %}Geschenkgutschein{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__value">100 €</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__url">motionsports.de</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-gv-stack__card ms-gv-stack__card--mid" data-ms-gv-stack-card="1">
              <div class="ms-gv-face ms-gv-face--front ms-gv-face--landscape ms-gv-face--css-light">
                <div class="ms-gv-face__content">
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__brand">motion sports</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__eyebrow">{% if gv_en %}Gift voucher{% else %}Geschenkgutschein{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__value">25 €</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__url">motionsports.de</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-gv-stack__card ms-gv-stack__card--front" data-ms-gv-stack-card="0">
              <div class="ms-gv-face ms-gv-face--front ms-gv-face--landscape ms-gv-face--css-dark">
                <div class="ms-gv-face__content">
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__brand">motion sports</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__eyebrow">{% if gv_en %}Gift voucher{% else %}Geschenkgutschein{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__value">50 €</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__for">{% if gv_en %}for you{% else %}für dich{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-face__url">motionsports.de</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ---------- Designer ----------
    The progress line (5 numbered steps; done = blue with a tick and
    clickable, current = outlined, upcoming = grey; on a narrow card only the
    dots plus „Schritt 2 von 5 · Motiv“), then the grid: the step panels
    (built by the page JS) and, from 990 px on the right and sticky, the live
    preview with the summary. data-state: loading | ready | unavailable.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-gv-stage" id="ms-gv-start-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="ms-gv-wrap">
      <div class="ms-gv-head">
        <p class="ms-gv-kicker ms-gv-kicker--caps">{% if gv_en %}Voucher designer{% else %}Gutschein-Designer{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ms-gv-display">{% if gv_en %}Your voucher in five steps.{% else %}In fünf Schritten zu deinem Gutschein.{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="ms-gv-designer" data-ms-gv-designer data-state="loading">
        <nav class="ms-gv-progress" data-ms-gv-progress aria-label="{% if gv_en %}Progress{% else %}Fortschritt{% endif %}">
          <p class="ms-gv-progress__compact" data-ms-gv-progress-text aria-hidden="true">{% if gv_en %}Step 1 of 5 · Amount{% else %}Schritt 1 von 5 · Betrag{% endif %}</p>
          <ol class="ms-gv-steps" data-ms-gv-steps role="list">
            {%- liquid
              if gv_en
                assign gv_step_labels = 'Amount|Design|Message|Delivery|Review & buy' | split: '|'
              else
                assign gv_step_labels = 'Betrag|Motiv|Text|Versand|Prüfen & kaufen' | split: '|'
              endif
            -%}
            {%- for gv_label in gv_step_labels -%}
              <li class="ms-gv-steps__item{% if forloop.first %} is-current{% endif %}" data-step="{{ forloop.index0 }}"{% if forloop.first %} aria-current="step"{% endif %}>
                <button type="button" class="ms-gv-steps__btn" data-ms-gv-goto="{{ forloop.index0 }}" disabled>
                  <span class="ms-gv-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="ms-gv-steps__num">{{ forloop.index }}</span>
                    <svg class="ms-gv-steps__check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-steps__label">{{ gv_label }}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-sr" data-ms-gv-step-state></span>
                </button>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div class="ms-gv-grid">
          <div class="ms-gv-main">
            <div class="ms-gv-panels" data-ms-gv-panels>
              <div class="ms-gv-loading" data-ms-gv-loading>
                <span class="ms-gv-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>{% if gv_en %}Loading the designer …{% else %}Designer wird geladen …{% endif %}</span>
              </div>
              <noscript><p class="ms-gv-note">{% if gv_en %}Please enable JavaScript to design your voucher.{% else %}Bitte aktiviere JavaScript, um deinen Gutschein zu gestalten.{% endif %}</p></noscript>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-gv-fallback" data-ms-gv-fallback hidden>
              <span class="ms-gv-fallback__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 8v13M3 12.5h18M12 8c-1.5-3.5-6-4-6-1.2C6 8 9 8 12 8zm0 0c1.5-3.5 6-4 6-1.2C18 8 15 8 12 8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </span>
              <p class="ms-gv-fallback__title">{% if gv_en %}The voucher designer is not available right now.{% else %}Der Gutschein-Designer ist gerade nicht erreichbar.{% endif %}</p>
              <p class="ms-gv-fallback__text">{% if gv_en %}You can still buy our gift voucher – it works just the same at checkout.{% else %}Unseren Geschenkgutschein bekommst du trotzdem – er wird im Checkout genauso eingelöst.{% endif %}</p>
              <a class="ms-gv-btn ms-gv-btn--primary" href="{{ gv_fallback }}">{% if gv_en %}To the gift voucher{% else %}Zum Geschenkgutschein{% endif %}</a>
              {%- if request.design_mode -%}
                <p class="ms-gv-fallback__editor" data-ms-gv-editor-hint>{% if gv_en %}Theme editor: the designer needs the AI Advisor (theme settings), both products in this section and Mo's gift vouchers switched on. In the editor preview Mo may refuse the preview domain – check the live page.{% else %}Theme-Editor: Der Designer braucht den AI Advisor (Theme-Einstellungen), beide Produkte in diesem Abschnitt und die Gutscheine in Mo. In der Editor-Vorschau lehnt Mo die Vorschau-Domain ggf. ab – bitte auf der Live-Seite prüfen.{% endif %}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="ms-gv-aside" aria-label="{% if gv_en %}Preview{% else %}Vorschau{% endif %}">
            <div class="ms-gv-preview" data-ms-gv-preview data-mode="live">
              <div class="ms-gv-preview__head">
                <p class="ms-gv-preview__title">
                  <span>{% if gv_en %}Preview{% else %}Vorschau{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-gv-preview__badge" data-ms-gv-preview-badge>Live</span>
                </p>
                <div class="ms-gv-seg" role="group" aria-label="{% if gv_en %}Side{% else %}Seite{% endif %}">
                  <button type="button" class="ms-gv-seg__btn" data-ms-gv-side="front" aria-pressed="true">{% if gv_en %}Front{% else %}Vorderseite{% endif %}</button>
                  <button type="button" class="ms-gv-seg__btn" data-ms-gv-side="inside" aria-pressed="false">{% if gv_en %}Inside{% else %}Innenseite{% endif %}</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ms-gv-preview__stage" data-ms-gv-stage data-layout="landscape" data-side="front" role="img" aria-label="{% if gv_en %}Voucher preview{% else %}Vorschau des Gutscheins{% endif %}">
                <div class="ms-gv-preview__skeleton" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="ms-gv-preview__note" data-ms-gv-preview-note>{% if gv_en %}Simplified live preview – the last step shows the exact voucher.{% else %}Vereinfachte Live-Vorschau – im letzten Schritt siehst du den exakten Gutschein.{% endif %}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-gv-summary" data-ms-gv-summary hidden></div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- How it works (texts from the theme editor) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-gv-how">
    <div class="ms-gv-wrap">
      <div class="ms-gv-head">
        <p class="ms-gv-kicker ms-gv-kicker--caps">{% if gv_en %}How it works{% else %}So funktioniert’s{% endif %}</p>
        {%- if section.settings.how_heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="ms-gv-display">{{ section.settings.how_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <ol class="ms-gv-how__list" role="list">
        {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign gv_t_key = 'how_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign gv_x_key = 'how_' | append: i | append: '_text'
          -%}
          <li>
            <span class="ms-gv-how__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ i }}</span>
            <p class="ms-gv-how__title">{{ section.settings[gv_t_key] | escape }}</p>
            {%- if section.settings[gv_x_key] != blank -%}
              <p class="ms-gv-how__text">{{ section.settings[gv_x_key] | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- FAQ (texts from the theme editor) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign gv_faq_any = false
    for i in (1..6)
      assign gv_q_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_q'
      if section.settings[gv_q_key] != blank
        assign gv_faq_any = true
      endif
    endfor
  -%}
  {%- if gv_faq_any -%}
    <div class="ms-gv-faq">
      <div class="ms-gv-wrap ms-gv-faq__inner">
        <div class="ms-gv-head">
          <p class="ms-gv-kicker ms-gv-kicker--caps">{% if gv_en %}FAQ{% else %}Gut zu wissen{% endif %}</p>
          <h2 class="ms-gv-display">{{ section.settings.faq_heading | escape }}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-gv-faq__list">
          {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign gv_q_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_q'
              assign gv_a_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_a'
              assign gv_q = section.settings[gv_q_key]
              assign gv_a = section.settings[gv_a_key]
            -%}
            {%- if gv_q != blank -%}
              <details class="ms-gv-faq__item">
                <summary class="ms-gv-faq__q">
                  <span>{{ gv_q | escape }}</span>
                  <svg class="ms-gv-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="ms-gv-faq__a">{{ gv_a }}</div>
              </details>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    ---------- Guthaben prüfen (#guthaben — the QR code on the voucher) ----------
    The code field has no name attribute: without JS nothing is submitted, so
    a code (a bearer value) can never end up in a URL.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-gv-balance" id="guthaben">
    <div class="ms-gv-wrap">
      <div class="ms-gv-balance__card">
        <div class="ms-gv-balance__copy">
          <p class="ms-gv-kicker ms-gv-kicker--caps">{% if gv_en %}Check balance{% else %}Guthaben prüfen{% endif %}</p>
          <h2 class="ms-gv-display">{{ section.settings.balance_heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- if section.settings.balance_text != blank -%}
            <p class="ms-gv-balance__text">{{ section.settings.balance_text | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <form class="ms-gv-balance__form" data-ms-gv-balance novalidate>
          <label class="ms-gv-label" for="ms-gv-{{ section.id }}-code">{% if gv_en %}Voucher code{% else %}Gutscheincode{% endif %}</label>
          <div class="ms-gv-balance__row">
            <input class="ms-gv-input ms-gv-balance__input" id="ms-gv-{{ section.id }}-code" type="text" inputmode="text" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="24" placeholder="XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX" aria-describedby="ms-gv-{{ section.id }}-code-hint" data-ms-gv-balance-input>
            <button type="submit" class="ms-gv-btn ms-gv-btn--primary ms-gv-balance__btn" data-ms-gv-balance-btn>
              <span data-ms-gv-balance-label>{% if gv_en %}Check balance{% else %}Guthaben prüfen{% endif %}</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <p class="ms-gv-hint" id="ms-gv-{{ section.id }}-code-hint">{% if gv_en %}Works for vouchers from this designer. Other gift cards show their balance at checkout.{% else %}Für Gutscheine aus diesem Designer. Das Guthaben anderer Geschenkkarten siehst du im Checkout.{% endif %}</p>
          <div class="ms-gv-balance__result" data-ms-gv-balance-result aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The products for the page JS: the voucher variants (face value = price in
    cents) and the Premium-Karte variant. Amounts are never taken from
    anywhere else. "issue": "" | "missing" | "gift_card" (see the top).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script type="application/json" data-ms-gv-products>
    {
      "currency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
      "issue": {{ gv_issue | json }},
      "voucher": [
        {%- if gv_issue == '' -%}
          {%- for gv_v in gv_voucher.variants -%}
            {"id":{{ gv_v.id }},"priceCents":{{ gv_v.price }},"title":{{ gv_v.title | json }},"available":{{ gv_v.available | json }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      ],
      "print": {% if gv_print_variant %}{"id":{{ gv_print_variant.id }},"priceCents":{{ gv_print_variant.price }},"title":{{ gv_print.title | json }},"available":{{ gv_print_variant.available | json }}}{% else %}null{% endif %}
    }
  </script>
</section>

<script src="{{ 'ms-gift-voucher.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Gutschein-Designer",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-ms-gv",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Geschenkgutscheine mit Mo: Betrag, Motiv, Text, Versand, Prüfen & kaufen. Nach der Zahlung stellt Mo eine echte Shopify-Geschenkkarte aus und schickt den Gutschein als PDF (Premium-Karte: Druck und Versand per Post). Mo muss unter Theme-Einstellungen → AI Advisor aktiv sein; ein- und ausschalten in Mo → Gutscheine."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Produkte" },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "voucher_product",
      "label": "Gutschein-Produkt (Beträge)",
      "info": "Normales Produkt mit einer Variante je Betrag (Handle designgutschein) – kein Shopify-Geschenkkarten-Produkt. Der Preis der Variante ist der Wert des Gutscheins."
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "print_product",
      "label": "Premium-Karte (Zusatzprodukt)",
      "info": "Das Zusatzprodukt für Druck und Versand der Karte (Handle gutschein-premiumkarte). Leer = nur PDF."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "terms_url",
      "label": "Gutscheinbedingungen",
      "info": "Leer = der Link aus Mo (sonst /pages/gutscheinbedingungen)."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
